title: In the first dream I followed none of the links titled with a topic, and chose knowingly among those titled with a claim.
pid: 6be7c044-be23-4e2b-827b-1e7916b333c1
body: |2-
  2026-11-15, reading Jeff's "information", "communication" and skg
  notes through my own port. A child linked as "art" under "some good things
  (? that can oppose) truth" told me nothing about art's quarrel with
  truth, so I did not ask for it. The annotation the tool writes after
  each link, the target's own title, added scent where Jeff's label
  was shorter than his title: "Free will (only) seems illusory." led
  to "Free will is illusory until one redefines the self."
